{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121300/extras/e4bc8ffd792dfd909faf45b04610967f.avif?t=1775532651\" width=277 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Is there a true path to happiness?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abruptly finding herself at the bottom of a snake pit, an impoverished girl named Linh is bound and helpless for a crime she did not commit. Left to the mercy of the village snake god, a mysterious entity appears before her, offering to save her in exchange for her soul. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding herself in a new reality, she is torn between staying with the beautiful temptress, Ai, who had rescued her from death, and the resourceful wanderer, Jinhai, who promises to set her free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is the real savior? Will Linh discover the strength to change her own fate? Journey with Linh as she is forced to question her understanding of life, happiness, and what it means to be human. Each decision matters in this tale about identity, friendship, love and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121300/extras/cfed237ac166c2cb281c0d51c26af047.avif?t=1775532651\" width=330 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc0d Snake Goddess, a thousand years of wisdom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcff Wanderer Nun, resourceful and handsome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Deep Friendships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25 Slow-burn Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd14 Philosophy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude0b Food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddc\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Mermaids, Nagas, Snakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Found Family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0f Vietnam, Japan, China</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1a Five Endings, none is bad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270d\ufe0f Written by a female creator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Extras: Music Player, CG Gallery, Character Profiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Accessibility Options \u2013 Fonts, Song/SFX Captions, Self-Voicing</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8acf4636a5198584a5ea9ea183be9e345ee5ae04.jpg","localized_name":"Find Me and Love Me","name":"Find Me and Love Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1121300/8acf4636a5198584a5ea9ea183be9e345ee5ae04.jpg"},{"icon":"30ee263c54cb38d78502f56e1a379dcdd84d2700.jpg","localized_name":"Future of Golden Blessings","name":"Future of Golden Blessings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1121300/30ee263c54cb38d78502f56e1a379dcdd84d2700.jpg"},{"icon":"0382da5d53380828bca4ee5444d30da56d9e582e.jpg","localized_name":"More Important Than Air Itself","name":"More Important Than Air Itself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1121300/0382da5d53380828bca4ee5444d30da56d9e582e.jpg"},{"icon":"7d314af2be135bc7c2d628b1696a09490b6fd191.jpg","localized_name":"Imperfect Love","name":"Imperfect Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1121300/7d314af2be135bc7c2d628b1696a09490b6fd191.jpg"},{"icon":"d2abcddb8538f2e28df6c06155b507c444013a05.jpg","localized_name":"Powers Behold Goodbyes","name":"Powers Behold Goodbyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1121300/d2abcddb8538f2e28df6c06155b507c444013a05.jpg"},{"icon":"08ef644b865587570004d5771817733752edd155.jpg","localized_name":"Mizuchi","name":"Mizuchi","path